  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dark Star v2**: back after 95 archived shows (932 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2020-01-19.travitz.schoepsCMC64v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 179 min; rated 2.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the band sounds like they're enjoying themselves, and the recording was shared soon after the show [3]\n- Reviewer finds the set list strong but the band low on energy, seemingly on autopilot compared with expectations [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2020-01-19.travitz.schoepsCMC64v.flac16**: taped by Jeff Travitz; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps CMC64v's>V3>SD744t [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps CMC64v microphones into a Sound Devices 744t at 24-bit/44.1kHz; Transfer chain: WAV edited in Soundforge Pro 13 (fades, POW-r dither to 16-bit), tracked as CDWAV, then encoded to FLAC with Trader's Little Helper [1]",
